{"id":"c1ba7d6724fa12ad","group":"20","path":"20/20-cor-nonzero-low-ce-degree.md","title":"低 c.e. 非零度的存在","display":"cor-nonzero-low-ce-degree — 低 c.e. 非零度的存在","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-cor-nonzero-low-ce-degree","aliases":["20-cor-nonzero-low-ce-degree"],"display":"cor-nonzero-low-ce-degree — 低 c.e. 非零度的存在","chapter":"7","section":"7.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 7.2.1 的推论","source_pdf_pages":[183],"source_printed_pages":[149],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-low-simple]]","[[20-df-redeg]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-cor-nonzero-low-ce-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-cor-nonzero-low-ce-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-nonzero-low-ce-degree — 低 c.e. 非零度的存在"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 7.2.1 的推论"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>183</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>149</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b0bd67260e33f88d\" href=\"?note=b0bd67260e33f88d\" title=\"20-thm-low-simple\">20-thm-low-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>本命题是 §7.2 的低简单集合推论；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0\">\\(\\mathbf0\\)</span> 及度跳跃均采用所引定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b0bd67260e33f88d\" href=\"?note=b0bd67260e33f88d\" title=\"20-thm-low-simple\">20-thm-low-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 是 c.e. 度族，见上游 redeg；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{deg}\">\\(\\mathrm{deg}\\)</span> 只区分集合族和度族。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}nonzero\\text{-}low\\text{-}ce\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf a&#39;=\\mathbf0&#39;].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}nonzero\\text{-}low\\text{-}ce\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf a&#39;=\\mathbf0&#39;].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>简单集合不可计算，所以低简单集合给出此度。本条仅表达低非零 c.e. 度的存在性；其见证由上游低简单集合取得。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.2.1 的推论；印刷页 149；PDF 第 183 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-low-simple","status":"resolved","id":"b0bd67260e33f88d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-low-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-low-simple","status":"resolved","id":"b0bd67260e33f88d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-low-simple]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-low-simple]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{deg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}nonzero\\text{-}low\\text{-}ce\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf0<\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf a'=\\mathbf0'].","display":true}],"bytes":1311,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["b0bd67260e33f88d","f389bdba28de0478"]}